«MDT Group» always looks after its clients, from selecting materials through to convenient delivery and payment options. In this section you can find our delivery and payment options.

We bring materials straight from the manufacturer's factory to the door of your site. We ship all materials from Europe; this usually takes about 3-4 weeks, depending on stock at the manufacturer's warehouse.

Some materials are in stock at our warehouse; these are delivered as soon as we receive an advance payment or full prepayment.

We deliver by road throughout Ukraine, to any address a vehicle can easily reach.

Bank transfer payment is available to both individuals and companies.

To pay for an order, you can collect an invoice with our bank details at our office, or order on the website and leave an email address; the invoice will be sent once the ordered goods and their availability are confirmed. Invoices can also be sent by fax.

The invoice can be paid at any bank or from your own account within three working days, during which the ordered goods are held in reserve.

Once you have chosen a material, a prepayment is made in advance at the Piraeus Bank euro selling rate on the day of payment. The balance is paid when the goods arrive at the warehouse. The arrival date is stated on the invoice you receive.

&nbsp;

If you have any further questions about delivery and payment, please call us on the numbers shown. Our managers will be glad to answer all your questions. We look forward to your call!

